<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:40px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free Tools</p>
      <h2>How much life insurance do you actually need?</h2>
      <p class="lead narrow">Most people guess. Adults under 30 overestimate the cost of coverage by
      as much as ten times. Here's a two&#8209;minute answer based on real numbers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2" style="gap:28px;align-items:start">
      <div class="calc">
        <div class="calc__head">
          <h3>Coverage Calculator</h3>
          <p>Based on the DIME method: Debt, Income, Mortgage, Education.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="calc__body">
          <form id="coverage-calc">
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-debt">Debts, not counting mortgage</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-debt" min="0" step="1000" value="15000" required>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-mortgage">Mortgage balance</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-mortgage" min="0" step="1000" value="180000" required>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-income">Your annual income</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-income" min="0" step="1000" value="60000" required>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-years">Years family would need it</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-years" min="1" max="40" value="10" required>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-kids">Children to educate</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-kids" min="0" max="10" value="2" required>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="cc-final">Final expenses</label>
                <input type="number" id="cc-final" min="0" step="1000" value="12000" required>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cc-savings">Savings &amp; existing coverage to subtract</label>
              <input type="number" id="cc-savings" min="0" step="1000" value="25000" required>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn--primary btn--block" type="submit">Calculate My Number</button>
          </form>

          <div id="cc-output" class="calc__result hidden">
            <span>Estimated coverage need</span>
            <b id="cc-total">$0</b>
            <div class="calc__break">
              <div><span>Debts</span><span id="cc-b-debt">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Income replacement</span><span id="cc-b-income">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Mortgage payoff</span><span id="cc-b-mortgage">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Education</span><span id="cc-b-edu">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Final expenses</span><span id="cc-b-final">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Less savings &amp; coverage</span><span id="cc-b-savings">$0</span></div>
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn--primary btn--block mt2" href="contact.html">Talk Through My Number</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="calc">
        <div class="calc__head">
          <h3>Real&#8209;Cost Estimator</h3>
          <p>What 20&#8209;year level term actually tends to cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="calc__body">
          <form id="cost-calc">
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ce-age">Your age</label>
                <input type="number" id="ce-age" min="18" max="70" value="35" required>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ce-sex">Sex</label>
                <select id="ce-sex"><option value="m">Male</option><option value="f">Female</option></select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="field-row">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ce-amount">Coverage amount</label>
                <input type="number" id="ce-amount" min="25000" step="25000" value="500000" required>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="ce-tobacco">Tobacco use</label>
                <select id="ce-tobacco"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn--navy btn--block" type="submit">Show Me the Real Cost</button>
          </form>

          <div id="ce-output" class="calc__result hidden">
            <span>Estimated monthly premium</span>
            <b id="ce-total">$0</b>
            <div class="calc__break">
              <div><span>Per day</span><span id="ce-daily">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Per year</span><span id="ce-annual">$0</span></div>
              <div><span>Coffees per month it equals</span><span id="ce-coffee">0</span></div>
            </div>
            <p class="small muted mt2 mb0">Illustration only. Your actual rate depends on health, carrier
            and underwriting.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--navy btn--block mt2" href="contact.html">Get a Real Quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel--warn narrow mt3">
      <h4>About these numbers</h4>
      <p class="mb0">Both tools are educational estimates, not quotes, offers, or recommendations. The cost
