    <h2>11. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Southern Comprehensive Insurance, LLC and Roosevelt Brown Jr.
    are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages arising from your
    use of, or inability to use, this website.</p>

    <h2>12. Indemnification</h2>
